  "problem": "ffone-client network_world_runtime resolves an XDT m_pstrMMeshModelString with an exact, case-sensitive probe against logicalName or legacyAliases. Nineteen installed models whose package route differs from their Unity root name carried an empty alias list, so their XDT names could not reach an installed GLB and every NPC selecting them rendered nothing. The models themselves were already published; only the generated registry was wrong.",
  "inputs": [
    {
      "role": "installed-character-registry",
      "path": "../FFOneClient/assets/game/_runtime/characters.json",
      "blake3Before": "see report registryBlake3Before"
    },
    {
      "role": "installed-table-set",
      "path": "../FFOneClient/assets/game/data/tables/table-set.json",
      "note": "supplies the exact XDT spelling; 505 distinct NPC/Nano mesh names"
    },
    {
      "role": "installer-rule-reference",
      "path": "crates/ffone-asset-pipeline/src/semantic_character_install.rs",
      "note": "legacy_aliases() derives the same alias from the legacy route stem"
    },
    {
      "role": "runtime-consumer",
      "path": "../FFOneClient/crates/ffone-client/src/network_world_runtime.rs",
      "note": "parse_character_registry builds by_logical_name; lookup is registry_models.get(logical_name)"
    },
    {
      "role": "plan-report",
      "path": "work/legacy-sources/chars-additive-20260902/alias-repair-plan.json"
    },
    {
      "role": "apply-report",
      "path": "work/legacy-sources/chars-additive-20260902/alias-repair-applied.json"
    }
  ],
  "outputs": [
